<span data-as=3D"p">When Agent decides to test itself, here=E2=80=99s what =
happens:</span>
<ol>
<li><strong>Browser Preview</strong>: You=E2=80=99ll see a browser preview =
within the Agent pane</li>
<li><strong>Visual Testing</strong>: Watch Agent=E2=80=99s cursor as it cli=
cks around your app, testing functionality</li>
<li><strong>Real User Simulation</strong>: Agent navigates through your app=
lication just like a real user would, entering mock data when necessary</li=
>
<li><strong>Automatic Analysis</strong>: Agent analyzes the test results an=
d identifies any issues</li>
<li><strong>Self-Correction</strong>: Agent reports back with a summary of =
its tests and automatically fixes any issues that crop up</li>
</ol>
