<span data-as=3D"p">Agent intelligently tests your application by navigatin=
g through it like a real user would, covering:</span>
<ul>
<li><strong>User interface validation</strong>: Buttons, forms, navigation,=
 and visual elements</li>
<li><strong>Functionality verification</strong>: Core features and user wor=
kflows</li>
<li><strong>Integration testing</strong>: API calls, database interactions,=
 and third-party services</li>
<li><strong>Performance and accessibility</strong>: Load times, responsiven=
ess, and accessibility standards</li>
</ul>
